# This repo tracks only the extracted locale CSVs (Key,Value translation
# tables produced by RobloxExtractor). Everything else in this working tree
# (source code, the .rbxm, decompiled scripts, etc.) is intentionally ignored.

# Ignore everything by default...
*

# ...but let git traverse into directories to find what's allowed below...
!*/

# ...and allow only locale CSV exports, wherever a "Locales" folder appears.
!/**/Locales/*.csv

# Keep this file itself tracked.
!/.gitignore

# These are separate, independent git repos vendored in this working tree;
# never let them get pulled in as embedded-repo gitlinks.
/lunaux-decompiler/
/unluau/
